    docs(readme): correct spec counts to 450 .spec.md / 452 incl .scl
    
    The README carried 447 .spec.md / 449 incl .scl in four count locations
    while the tree holds 450 .spec.md files plus 2 .scl specs. Every edited
    figure was derived from commands run in this worktree:
    
      find specs -name '*.spec.md' | wc -l            -> 450
      find specs -name '*.scl'     | wc -l            -> 2
      node bin/speclang status                        -> Specs: 452 (450 .spec.md + 2 .scl)
    
    Locations corrected:
      159  Current Status "What Works" bullet
      494  File Structure tree comment
      540  "What Works vs What Doesn't" spec-validation bullet
      634  Footer status line
    
    Line 355 (Quick Start step 2) documented an output line the validator
    does not print. `python3 scripts/validate_autonomous.py --project`
    emits one "Validation Report" block per spec, each PASSED, with no
    aggregate "N specs validated" summary, so the stale count is replaced
    by the real output shape and a pointer to `node bin/speclang status`.
